{"unit_id":"aaronlei__dsh-width-tiers#card-zh","repo":"aaronlei/dsh-width-tiers","commit":"f0e0241b0e44ea426131d57e9199c2ec3ceecc40","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-width-tiers 是面向 DSH Web 的对话宽度插件，在 shell.overlay 界面层加入悬浮档位按钮和选择菜单。它使用应用原生对话宽度变量，让内置拖动手柄继续调整宽度，并提供标准、中等、宽、超宽、全宽和自定义六种选择。用户可通过菜单选档，也可拖动原生边缘保存自定义宽度；选择会在下次访问时恢复，并同步到其他标签页。全宽档会收起左侧栏，标准档恢复应用默认宽度。菜单支持键盘导航，界面文字随应用语言切换。适合希望在 DSH 网页端快速调整阅读空间的用户；不需要额外账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:77-91","src/client/model.ts:21-30","src/client/controller.ts:255-339","src/client/controller.ts:468-543"]}
{"unit_id":"aaronlei__dsh-width-tiers#card-en","repo":"aaronlei/dsh-width-tiers","commit":"f0e0241b0e44ea426131d57e9199c2ec3ceecc40","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-width-tiers adds a DSH Web menu with six conversation widths: standard, medium, wide, ultra, full and custom. It uses native controls, restores choices across visits and tabs, and collapses the left sidebar in full mode. Keyboard navigation and localized labels are included.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:77-91","src/client/model.ts:21-30","src/client/controller.ts:255-339","src/client/controller.ts:468-543"]}
