{"unit_id":"aaronlei__dsh-width-tiers#feature-1","repo":"aaronlei/dsh-width-tiers","commit":"f0e0241b0e44ea426131d57e9199c2ec3ceecc40","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-width-tiers 的功能「宽度档位」：在悬浮菜单中选择标准、中等、宽、超宽或全宽等对话宽度。选择后插件通过应用原生宽度轴应用档位，标准档则交还默认宽度。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/model.ts:21-30","src/client/controller.ts:255-309","src/client/WidthTierPicker.tsx:154-192"]}
