{"unit_id":"aaronlei__dsh-width-tiers#feature-3","repo":"aaronlei/dsh-width-tiers","commit":"f0e0241b0e44ea426131d57e9199c2ec3ceecc40","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-width-tiers 的功能「状态恢复与跨标签同步」：插件载入时恢复已保存档位，并监听浏览器 storage 变化；用户在其他标签页更新档位时，本页会采用新值。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/controller.ts:582-598","src/client/controller.ts:613-624"]}
{"unit_id":"aaronlei__dsh-width-tiers#feature-4","repo":"aaronlei/dsh-width-tiers","commit":"f0e0241b0e44ea426131d57e9199c2ec3ceecc40","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-width-tiers 的功能「键盘操作」：打开档位菜单后，可用上下方向键移动焦点、Home 和 End 跳到首尾，Escape 关闭菜单并将焦点还给按钮。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/WidthTierPicker.tsx:107-144"]}
